2. Create a small batch of art pieces to showcase in your store. This will allow you to test your store's setup, make any necessary adjustments, and have a starting point for promoting your work.
3. Promote your work through social media, email marketing, or other channels to drive traffic to your store and attract potential customers.

By following this order, you'll be able to test and refine your store's setup, create a foundation of art pieces to showcase, and then promote your work to attract customers. This approach will help you avoid feeling overwhelmed and allow you to make progress towards your goal in a logical and incremental manner.

